From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Scrub credential-shaped env from model-run commands

What: Scrub credential-shaped env from model-run commands
Why: Model-run shells, eval kernels, services and jq filters inherited ambient API keys and tokens; bash.envScrub (off by default) removes names matching KEY|PASSWORD|SECRET|TOKEN except a forward list, as DeepSeek Harness does.
Upstream-Status: Ombra-specific; idea from DeepSeek Harness; not submitted

